<title>UK: Medusa valuation expected at 13 mln stg - paper.</title>
<headline>Medusa valuation expected at 13 mln stg - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medusa Petroleum Plc, the oil exploration company, is expected to join the Alternative Investment Market in April at a value of 13 million stg ($20.74 million), the Times reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The company was raising eight million stg through a placing of 11.5 million shares at 50 pence per share, the Times said.</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717 ($1=.6267 Stg)</p>
